[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 12963.429, "timestamp": "03:36:03", "text": "我問她：「你接受過日語教學訓練嗎？」她說了什麼？是的，我做了。我做了。我第一天就這麼做了。我的天啊。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12976.55, "timestamp": "03:36:16", "text": "所以她不在那裡學習日語，對吧"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 12990.622, "timestamp": "03:36:30", "author": "@Her_escapes", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/k5qSeiW9HuWS-yTlvFtkJFgjFQNzT4clVmOKs1PPP76ezfBidoUedboWgIi3wJy0ffSGpxX2Gy8=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "who wants change! (everyone) who wants to change (none)"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13000.389, "timestamp": "03:36:40", "text": "？是的。是的，她確實這麼做了。哦，不錯"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13011.349, "timestamp": "03:36:51", "text": "。  我問她是不是因為她很優秀。她日語很好。她不願意承認這"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13013.51, "timestamp": "03:36:53", "text": "一點，因為這話聽起來很奇怪。"}]